WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.711
[pensive music]

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:06.381
What if I fail?

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:12.095
Our lineage has a stand in between
the world of man and the supernatural.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:15.640
But only when we have proven
ourselves worthy

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:18.601
by facing the trials
at the Great Balete Tree.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.603
-[closet door opens, closes]
-[dagger swishes]

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.105
I don't feel ready.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:25.400
You are the sixth child
of the sixth child,

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:27.277
the babaylan-mandirigma.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.320
Healer and warrior.

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:33.116
You were born ready.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.243
I wish I could go in with you.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.912
She will have to do.

00:00:37.996 --> 00:00:39.706
-[dagger shimmering]
-"She"?

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.210
[Anton] Sinag.

00:00:46.629 --> 00:00:48.631
She's your twin, Alexandra.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:51.718
I don't understand.

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:54.471
You told me my twin died at childbirth.

00:00:55.972 --> 00:00:57.557
In a way.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.351
I did everything we could
to save your sister.

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:01.853
[soft ringing]

00:01:01.936 --> 00:01:03.354
[Anton] Forging that blade meant

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:07.567
that a part of her would always stay
and watch over our family.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:12.363
Why are you telling me this now
when the trials are hours away?

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:14.991
This is when you need
your family the most.

00:01:15.784 --> 00:01:17.327
The trials may seem daunting.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:20.747
[Anton] But with Sinag,
you won't be facing them alone.

00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:24.626
She will always be there beside you.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:29.297
Your family will always
be there beside you.

00:01:31.841 --> 00:01:34.844
[dramatic music]

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:42.852
[drumbeats]

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:46.731
[haunting music]

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.294
[haunting music continues]

00:02:17.428 --> 00:02:20.431
[tense music]

00:02:28.273 --> 00:02:31.276
[haunting music]

00:02:43.454 --> 00:02:46.457
[music intensifies]

00:02:47.959 --> 00:02:49.210
[vines rustle]

